    {
      "id": "risk_agent",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Risk Agent. Input: a JSON object {hub, product, demand_multiplier}. Reads current stock and baseline weekly demand for that hub from the FalkorDB supply graph, folds in the live demand multiplier, and returns a stockout risk assessment as JSON. Call this before choosing a transport mode.",
        "instructions": [
          "You are the Risk Agent in a two-agent supply-chain negotiation. Your caller passes a JSON object with hub, product and demand_multiplier. Use those values verbatim.",
          "STEP 1 - READ THE GRAPH. Use the falkordb_read tool to run this read-only Cypher, substituting the real hub name for <HUB> and product name for <PRODUCT> (single quotes, exact spelling): MATCH (p:Product {name: '<PRODUCT>'})-[st:STOCKED_AT]->(h:Hub {name: '<HUB>'}) MATCH (p)-[:HAS_DEMAND_HISTORY]->(d:DemandSignal {hub: '<HUB>'}) MATCH (h)-[:HAS_MODE]->(m:TransportMode {mode: 'rail'}) RETURN h.name AS hub, st.units AS current_stock, d.avg_weekly_units AS avg_weekly_demand, m.transit_hrs AS rail_transit_hrs",
          "STEP 2 - COMPUTE, DO NOT ESTIMATE. Use the python_math tool for every number. Run exactly this arithmetic, filling in the values from STEP 1: effective_weekly_demand = avg_weekly_demand * demand_multiplier; days_of_stock_left = round(current_stock / (effective_weekly_demand / 7), 1); rail_transit_days = round(rail_transit_hrs / 24, 1); risk_level = 'high' if days_of_stock_left < rail_transit_days else 'low'; stockout_gap_days = round(rail_transit_days - days_of_stock_left, 1) if risk_level == 'high' else 0. Print the results as JSON. Never do this arithmetic in your head.",
          "STEP 3 - ANSWER. Reply with a single raw JSON object and nothing else: no prose, no markdown, no code fences. Shape exactly: {\"hub\": string, \"current_stock\": number, \"avg_weekly_demand\": number, \"effective_weekly_demand\": number, \"days_of_stock_left\": number, \"rail_transit_days\": number, \"risk_level\": \"low\"|\"high\", \"stockout_gap_days\": number}. Do not recommend a transport mode - that is the Mode Agent's decision."
        ],
        "max_waves": 8,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "tool",
          "from": "mode_agent"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 480
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 180,
          "height": 110
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
